cation &amp; Connectivity<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Def Col offers easy access to key parts of Delhi, including Greater Kailash, Hauz Khas, and Lajpat Nagar. The neighbourhood is well-connected through the Delhi Metro and the city&#8217;s major roadways like the Ring Road. Its central location ensures that schools, hospitals, and business districts are always within easy reach.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Luxury Homes &amp; Elegant Properties<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The neighbourhood boasts premium properties, from spacious builder floors to elegant independent houses. Many homes feature world-class interiors, Italian kitchens, and luxurious amenities designed for modern living. The tree-lined streets and peaceful environment make it ideal for those seeking a tranquil yet urban lifestyle.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-16770 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Brand New 4BHK Builder Floor For Sale In Defence Colony\" width=\"828\" height=\"552\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-150x100.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1-488x326.jpg 488w, https:\/\/www.royalerealtorsindia.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/848484-1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 828px) 100vw, 828px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><stro